The Nutrition Plan
The Nutrition Agent analyzed Patient AK's germline mutations (MBD4 loss = BER deficiency) and current treatment (carboplatin):

Problem: Carboplatin creates DNA crosslinks. Patient AK's cells can't repair them (MBD4 broken). This makes chemo more effective against cancer but also increases toxicity in normal cells.

Solution: Protective nutrition targeting the specific pathway:

During carboplatin:

